## Citation

To cite Vitessce in your work, please use:

@article{keller2024vitessce,  title = {{Vitessce: integrative visualization of multimodal and spatially resolved single-cell data}},  author = {Keller, Mark S. and Gold, Ilan and McCallum, Chuck and Manz, Trevor and Kharchenko, Peter V. and Gehlenborg, Nils},  journal = {Nature Methods},  year = {2024},  month = sep,  doi = {10.1038/s41592-024-02436-x} }

If you use the image rendering functionality, please additionally cite Viv:

@article{manz2022viv,  title = {{Viv: multiscale visualization of high-resolution multiplexed bioimaging data on the web}},  author = {Manz, Trevor and Gold, Ilan and Patterson, Nathan Heath and McCallum, Chuck and Keller, Mark S. and Herr, II, Bruce W. and Börner, Kay and Spraggins, Jeffrey M. and Gehlenborg, Nils},  journal = {Nature Methods},  year = {2022},  month = may,  doi = {10.1038/s41592-022-01482-7} }
